273
00:28:57.069 --> 00:29:00.749
Right now I need
every soldier I've got.
We're goin' after them.

274
00:29:02.229 --> 00:29:04.709
Colonel Perry.

275
00:29:04.869 --> 00:29:07.389
We killed an innocent man.

276
00:29:07.549 --> 00:29:09.829
