448
00:43:55.877 --> 00:43:59.517
All right, all right, all right.
Here we go. All right?

449
00:43:59.637 --> 00:44:03.957
I'm all buckled up. All right,
look. Mr. Top Secret.

450
00:44:05.317 --> 00:44:07.597
